## Producer `ProduceAccumulator`

- Added `produceAccumulatorApi` to the invoked Producer core fixture. Java has
  one public `ProduceAccumulator(String)` constructor and zero declared public
  methods. The inherited `Object` methods do not expose batching operations.
- Rust keeps the corresponding accumulator private within `Producer`; the
  public mapped batching controls and send APIs remain on `Producer`.
